---
/**
 * Fine-tuning + RLHF lesson — illustration #1.
 *
 * The three-stage training pipeline: pretraining produces the base
 * model; supervised fine-tuning produces an instruction-following
 * model; RLHF produces the chat assistant. Each stage takes the
 * previous stage's output as its starting point and trains on
 * progressively smaller, more curated data.
 */
---

<figure class="cw-illus">
	<svg viewBox="0 0 800 280" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-labelledby="tp-title tp-desc">
		<title id="tp-title">The three-stage training pipeline</title>
		<desc id="tp-desc">A horizontal flow diagram. Stage one, pretraining: massive text corpus produces a base model that is good at predicting next tokens. Stage two, supervised fine-tuning: a much smaller curated dataset of instruction-response pairs produces an instruction-tuned model. Stage three, RLHF: a reward model trained on human preference comparisons is used to further optimize the instruction-tuned model into a chat assistant. Each stage starts from the previous stage's output.</desc>

		<defs>
			<marker id="cw-arrow-tp" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto">
				<path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="currentColor"/>
			</marker>
			<marker id="cw-arrow-tp-accent" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto">
				<path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#7c3aed"/>
			</marker>
		</defs>

		<rect x="20" y="60" width="220" height="110" rx="8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
		<text x="130" y="84" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor">1. Pretraining</text>
		<text x="130" y="106" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">data: massive text corpus</text>
		<text x="130" y="124" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">objective: next-token</text>
		<text x="130" y="138" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">prediction</text>
		<text x="130" y="158" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" font-style="italic" font-weight="600">→ base model</text>

		<line x1="244" y1="115" x2="282" y2="115" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#cw-arrow-tp)"/>

		<rect x="290" y="60" width="220" height="110" rx="8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
		<text x="400" y="84" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor">2. Fine-tuning (SFT)</text>
		<text x="400" y="106" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">data: curated</text>
		<text x="400" y="120" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">instruction-response pairs</text>
		<text x="400" y="138" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">objective: imitate examples</text>
		<text x="400" y="158" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" font-style="italic" font-weight="600">→ instruction-tuned model</text>

		<line x1="514" y1="115" x2="552" y2="115" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#cw-arrow-tp)"/>

		<rect x="560" y="60" width="220" height="110" rx="8" fill="none" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="2"/>
		<text x="670" y="84" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="600" fill="#7c3aed">3. RLHF</text>
		<text x="670" y="106" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">data: human preference</text>
		<text x="670" y="120" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">comparisons (A vs B)</text>
		<text x="670" y="138" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">objective: maximize reward</text>
		<text x="670" y="158" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#7c3aed" font-style="italic" font-weight="600">→ chat assistant</text>

		<text x="130" y="200" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.55">trillions of tokens</text>
		<text x="400" y="200" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.55">tens of thousands of examples</text>
		<text x="670" y="200" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.55">hundreds of thousands of comparisons</text>

		<text x="130" y="230" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.55">months on a cluster</text>
		<text x="400" y="230" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.55">days</text>
		<text x="670" y="230" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.55">days, with a separate reward model</text>

		<text x="400" y="260" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="currentColor" font-style="italic" opacity="0.7">data shrinks; signal sharpens; the model learns to be helpful</text>
	</svg>
	<figcaption>The three-stage training pipeline. Each stage is built on the output of the previous one. Data volume drops dramatically across stages (trillions of tokens → tens of thousands of examples → preference comparisons), but the signal at each step is increasingly targeted.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.cw-illus { margin: 1.75rem auto; max-width: 100%; }
	.cw-illus svg { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 780px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; }
	.cw-illus figcaption { text-align: center; font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.75; margin-top: 0.5rem; font-style: italic; }
</style>
